      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Speech Emotion Recognition UI\n----------------------------------------------------\nStreamlit, React, Typescript\n\n- Upload audio or live recording\n- Feature analysis of audio\n- Predict human emotion\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "Wgm-bQMBMFWXYG2cZm34C",
      "originalText": "Speech Emotion Recognition UI\n----------------------------------------------------\nStreamlit, React, Typescript\n\n- Upload audio or live recording\n- Feature analysis of audio\n- Predict human emotion\n",
